  "id": "dimensions-of-consciousness",
  "term": "dimensions of consciousness",
  "definition": "Dimensions of consciousness are the different aspects of conscious experience that may need separate explanation rather than a single account. In this usage, the term refers to complementary features of lived experience—such as cognitive access, self-related awareness, intrinsic felt experience, intentionality, temporality, and embodied situatedness—that different theories of consciousness may each illuminate.",
